The longlist was announced on 10 March 2022; the shortlist on 7 April 2022 and the winner on 26 May 2022.<ref name=IntBooker2022 /> ''[[Tomb of Sand]]'' is the first Hindi-language novel to receive a nomination, and the first novel in an [[Languages of India|Indian language]] to win the International Booker Prize.<ref>{{cite news |last1=Marshall |first1=Alex |title=Hindi Novel Wins International Booker Prize for the First Time |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2022/05/26/arts/international-booker-winner-tomb-of-sand.html |access-date=13 December 2023 |work=[[The New York Times]] |date=26 May 2022 |archive-date=13 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230213195641/https://www.nytimes.com/2022/05/26/arts/international-booker-winner-tomb-of-sand.html |url-status=live }}</ref>

