===2027===
In July 2026, it was announced that American writer [[Katie Kitamura]] would chair the judging panel for 2027; she will be joined by writer [[Patrick McGuinness]], British-Ghanaian writer [[Caleb Azumah Nelson]], Danish writer [[Olga Ravn]] and American actress [[Tessa Thompson]]. The longlist will be announced on 16 March 2027, and the shortlist will be announced on 15 April 2027. The winning book will be announced in May 2027.<ref>{{cite web |title=Bukhman Philanthropies to fund next decade of the International Booker Prize as judges announced for the 2027 prize {{!}} The Booker Prizes |url=https://thebookerprizes.com/media-centre/press-releases/bukhman-philanthropies-fund-next-decade-of-the-international-booker-prize |website=thebookerprizes.com |access-date=2 July 2026 |language=en |date=2 July 2026}}</ref>

